---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: whenNotPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_canceled: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_get_position: positionId = getInvestorPositionId(sender)
    q_get_position --> q_verify_exists: verifyPositionExists(positionId)
    q_verify_exists --> q_verify_sig: verifySignatureNotUsed(withdrawSignature)
    q_verify_sig --> q_verify_excess: verifyCanClaimExcessCapital(positionId)
    q_verify_excess --> q_mark_sig: usedSignatures[sender][sig] = true
    q_mark_sig --> q_mark_excess: position.hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_mark_excess --> q_decrement_total: totalCapitalInvested -= amount
    q_decrement_total --> q_decrement_investor: position.investedCapital -= amount
    q_decrement_investor --> q_update: updateInvestorPosition(investAmount, tokenAllocationRate, positionId)
    q_update --> q_verify_valid: verifyValidPosition(sig, positionId, WITHDRAW_EXCESS_CAPITAL)
    q_verify_valid --> q_emit: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(amount, sender, positionId)
    q_emit --> q_check_amount: amount > 0
    q_check_amount --> [*]: safeTransfer(bidToken, sender, amount)

    note right of q_verify_excess
        INV-001: investor can only claim excess once (hasClaimedExcess flag)
        INV-002: signature verified against legionSigner
        INV-003: position must match invested == cached after update
    end note

    note right of q_decrement_total
        INV-004: state decremented before transfer (CEI pattern)
        INV-005: underflow protection on investedCapital -= amount
    end note
